th guns and bullets, or with rituals and potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Large open world, different locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/9d1d057724113315e5c88c882782b2f6.poster.avif?t=1752438500\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/9d1d057724113315e5c88c882782b2f6.webm?t=1752438500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/9d1d057724113315e5c88c882782b2f6.mp4?t=1752438500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The game features a large open world, where you can explore different locations, while completing tasks and surviving. While exploring the game world - you will find notes of local residents, which will tell you various mystical stories about Svetlograd and its surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, when you start a new game - all game items (food, weapons, ammo, book pages, enemies, plants, mushrooms, animals, etc.) - appear in random places, it gives you the opportunity - to play each time a truly new and unique game, with an unpredictable ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construction, resource extraction and item creation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/174d0744fd3687de82827dd96b0d3f45.poster.avif?t=1752438500\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/174d0744fd3687de82827dd96b0d3f45.webm?t=1752438500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_