 >detailed survival mechanics - the ability to get wet, if you stay in the rain for a long time, the character freezes faster, until you warm up by the fire or dry out. Hunger, thirst, temperature, stamina, blood and cuts, infections, curses cast, the ability to brew and drink potions to get rid of curses or heal wounds, and more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >numerous crafting recipes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ability to collect recipes, ingredients and brew potions, perform rituals to banish dark forces;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >go boating, fishing, hunting, cooking on the fire or in the oven, helping each other, sharing resources, exploring the huge game world;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >every new game - loot (game items) - appear in random places, with a certain probability, enemies behave differently, mythical creatures appear differently, in one game they can be 3, in another 5;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >at the beginning of the game - you have ordinary equipment, weak weapons, but if you carefully explore the world - you can find a variety of weapons, meet the military, with a fairly advanced artificial intelligence and fight with them, or find a secret bunker with very rare weapons, but be careful, in the bunker....;</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Cooperative survival and horror genre. You and your family have returned to your native land, on which a terrible curse and darkness has fallen. Will you be able to survive in a harsh and dangerous environment and stop the evil? It depends only on you, on your skills and ability to help each other.",
